+- **Cache format (`Rails.cache`, `cache_format_version = 7.1`)**:
+  - Rails 7.2 writes `"\x00\x11"` binary cache entries.
+  - **Rollback to Rails 7.0 (Ruby 3.2.9)**: verified live via `FileStore`
