+(`config.load_defaults 8.1`), diffed all cryptographic, cookie, session, CSRF,
+message-verifier, cache, and ActiveRecord serialization files between Rails
+`7.2.4` and Rails `8.1.4.1`, and verified live end-to-end against Rails
+`8.1.4.1` running with `config.load_defaults 8.1` and all temporary overrides
