+   - Wire-format identical between Rails 7.2 (`load_defaults 7.2` + `:hybrid`)
+     and Rails 8.1 (`load_defaults 8.1`, `:json`, no SHA1 rotations):
+     - Both derive keys with SHA256 PBKDF2 (1000 iterations) and identical salts.
+     - Both use `aes-256-gcm` (encrypted cookies) and HMAC-SHA1 (signed cookies)
+       with identical `_rails.message` cookie metadata envelopes.
